## Summary

**Built and deployed:**
- Image `localhost/tidyquest:test` built with the updated code
- Running container on port **3050** (mapped to 3000 internally)

**Changes made to `client/src/components/pages/Settings.tsx`:**
1. Added `editingRewardTitle` and `editingRewardDesc` state (line 114)
2. Updated `startRewardEdit` to accept full reward object
3. Updated `cancelRewardEdit` to reset all fields
4. Updated `saveRewardEdit` to use edit state for title/description/cost
5. Updated UI to show input fields for title and description when editing

You can now test by:
1. Going to http://localhost:3050
2. Logging in as admin (ashton)
3. Going to Settings → scroll to "Rewards Catalog"
4. Click "Edit" on any reward — title and description should now be editable

